Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 06:44:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Add sunxi (Allwinner A31/A31s) system layer and build
 target

Power-up replayed from the stock driver, no OCP wrapper, rev 1.1.5/1.1.6
